+# Fleet PRE merge-chain certificate gate + Cloudflare fail-closed regression — 2026-09-16
+
+## Task
+Close the two still-open Architect (issue #80 / Owner Delta #3) acceptance items on current master `414179ea`:
+- **GAP B (A4)**: add a machine-checkable merge-chain gate so integration into `master` is allowed only when an unambiguous Fleet PRE `READY_FOR_OCEAN=YES` certificate names the EXACT final PR HEAD_SHA. Missing, skipped, different-SHA, stale, duplicate and self-signed certificates must block. Nothing today enforces this (`git grep READY_FOR_OCEAN|PRE_INTEGRATION_QA|FLEET_PRE` = 0 hits on master).
+- **A3 regression test**: PR #117 merged the fail-closed `cloudflare-preview.yml` step, but no regression test reproduces the historical #91/#113 FALSE-GREEN bypass class (missing/skipped Cloudflare credentials must never be reported green).
+
+## Why
+`Builder -> Fleet PRE -> Ocean -> Fleet POST` is the canonical pipeline contract; without a machine-checkable exact-SHA certificate gate, the protected integration stage can still proceed without an independent Fleet PRE certificate (duplicate/parallel-system risk).
+
