+
+## Target state
+One reusable gate (`scripts/check-fleet-pre-certificate.js` + pure logic in `lib/fleet-pre-certificate.js`) + one required CI job (`fleet-pre-cert` in `ci.yml`) + a falsifiable bypass-class fixture test for the Cloudflare fail-closed path. Fleet PRE (independent verifier role) publishes certificates into `data/fleet-pre-certificates/fleet-pre-<40hex>.json`.
